#################################################################
#  v9.50.0 (2026-09-07, brsf-session) -- dated correction to lineage 8
#  (L_ChangeDiscipline), appended, never edited in place (L-112).
#
#  The 2026-09-06 handover named the gap exactly: fw:It_CD1 carried no
#  hasState, so L4DeploymentShape (built to catch "a closed iteration
#  with no DeploymentUnit") had nothing to trigger on; no DeploymentUnit
#  connected the story to the releases that really shipped it; and
#  S_ChangeGuideDoc sat in fw:Register rather than a real package -- the
#  G16 pattern again. Re-verified before writing, not assumed:
